<li><strong>Graph execution gets suspended</strong> at the exact point wher=
e <a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python/langgraph/types/#langgr=
aph.types.interrupt" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><c=
