<span data-as=3D"p">This approach is useful when you want the approval logi=
c to live with the tool itself, making it reusable across different parts o=
f your graph. The LLM can call the tool naturally, and the interrupt will p=
ause execution whenever the tool is invoked, allowing you to approve, edit,=
 or cancel the action.</span>
